# Gather the White Lotus {4}{W}: "Create a 1/1 white Ally creature token for each Plains you control. Scry 2." On turn 5 Bot1
# controls a Plains and a Plateau (a Mountain Plains, so a Plains too, CR 205.3i) beside an Island, which is no Plains; Bot2's
# Plains is not counted (it is not "you control"). Paid with Plains, Plateau and Black Lotus (one mana more than the cost, no
# need for the Island), the spell makes exactly two Ally tokens, then Bot1 scries 2: the Mountain stays on top and the Swamp
# goes to the bottom, so the turn 7 draw is the Mountain.

